 "nl": [
  "Allow nvr to connect to engineering using SNMP (UDP 161).",
  "Restrict nvr so that its only permitted destinations are cameras on NTP (UDP 123); cameras on DNS over UDP 53; drop all other traffic it originates.",
  "Hosts in database may reach nvr over IMAP (TCP 143) and SSH (TCP 22).",
  "Hosts in edge-cache may reach engineering over HTTP (TCP 80) and HTTPS (TCP 443).",
  "edge-cache offers HTTPS (TCP 443) to every zone.",
  "Deny all traffic from guest-wifi to nvr (this overrides any public service).",
  "Permit any UDP port from edge-cache to engineering but deny TFTP (UDP 69), SNMP (UDP 161).",
  "guest-wifi must accept NTP (UDP 123) and syslog (UDP 514) and HTTP (TCP 80) from cameras.",
  "Hosts in cameras may reach database over SMTP (TCP 25).",
  "Any zone may connect to cameras over HTTPS (TCP 443).",
  "No packet from guest-wifi may enter nvr, even for services open to everyone.",
  "Hosts in engineering may reach database over PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) and SNMP (UDP 161) and IMAP (TCP 143).",
  "Hosts in database may reach engineering over RTSP (TCP 554).",
  "Apart from guest-wifi on HTTPS (TCP 443), all traffic originating in edge-cache must be dropped.",
  "nvr must accept RDP (TCP 3389) and SMTP (TCP 25) from guest-wifi.",
  "nvr may use TCP ports 1024-65535 towards cameras, except RDP (TCP 3389), PostgreSQL (TCP 5432), which must be blocked."
 ],
